1
00:00:00,098 --> 00:00:01,598
SHELDON:
Coming.

2
00:00:06,188 --> 00:00:08,108
Hey, have you seen Koothrappali?

3
00:00:08,815 --> 00:00:10,395
(Sheldon:)He's not here.

4
00:00:10,567 --> 00:00:13,317
Maybe the Avengers summoned him.

5
00:00:14,279 --> 00:00:17,119
He's not the Marvel Comics Thor,
he's the original Norse god.

6
00:00:17,282 --> 00:00:19,452
(Sheldon:)Thank you for the clarification.

7
00:00:19,618 --> 00:00:22,618
- I'm supposed to give him a ride home.
- I'm sure he'll be fine.

8
00:00:22,787 --> 00:00:24,787
(Sheldon:)He has his hammer.

9
00:00:28,585 --> 00:00:30,045
(Butterfly Girl:)Wow.

10
00:00:32,297 --> 00:00:36,427
(Butterfly Girl:)I have to say, you are an amazing man.

11
00:00:36,593 --> 00:00:39,973
(Butterfly Girl:)You're gentle and passionate.

12
00:00:40,138 --> 00:00:44,978
(Butterfly Girl:)And, my God,
you are such a good listener.

